* Tailored Brands ERP integration queues on QM1 (applied by the MQ container at start-up from /etc/mqm/20-tb.mqsc).
* ERP.ORDERS.IN  - orders for the ERP (today from TIBCO BW, during migration from the pubsub-to-jms-bridge)
* ERP.INVOICE.OUT - invoices the ERP emits back toward the integration layer
DEFINE QLOCAL('ERP.ORDERS.IN') DEFPSIST(YES) MAXDEPTH(100000) DESCR('Orders inbound to ERP') REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('ERP.INVOICE.OUT') DEFPSIST(YES) MAXDEPTH(100000) DESCR('Invoices outbound from ERP') REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('ERP.ORDERS.DLQ') DEFPSIST(YES) MAXDEPTH(100000) DESCR('Poison messages from ERP.ORDERS.IN') REPLACE
* Let the dev app user (channel DEV.APP.SVRCONN) use the ERP queues
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('ERP.**') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) PRINCIPAL('app') AUTHADD(BROWSE,GET,INQ,PUT)
